    "event_frame_validation": "Reject unknown kinds, missing event fields, malformed invocation/rejection payloads, and invalid cursor strings before cursor movement or callbacks. Event payloads remain opaque and unchanged.",
    "cursor_placement": "Only event envelopes may carry a cursor. Cursor-bearing client_invocation and session_rejection envelopes are rejected before capability/rejection delivery; valid cursorless controls still deliver. Non-event cursor values never alter replay position.",
    "handshake": "Session frames are ignored until a valid handshake acknowledgement; invalid acknowledgements leave queued controls unflushed and cannot dispatch a capability. Valid acknowledgement permits queued controls and later valid results.",
    "cross_realm_bytes": "Use typeof string narrowing across the declared string | Uint8Array union; file bytes serialize as JSON arrays. Strings, extra fields, provider metadata, and caller buffer remain unchanged.",
    "authority": "spec/streaming/ws/bindings/typescript.md handshake-first and cursor-only-on-event rules; SessionEventFrame and WsOutboundFrameEnvelope schema artifacts. No authority packet changed."
